cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "turath-catalog: classical Arabic works and their printed editions"
abstract: >-
  An open bibliographic dataset (metadata only) of classical Arabic works and their printed editions:
  works, editions (editor, publisher, place, year, edition number, volumes, pages), authors with Hijri
  death years and their Gregorian ranges, editors and their roles, and manuscript copies with their
  holding library. Every value names its source and every edition carries a confidence level. Works and
  authors link to OpenITI, Wikidata and al-Maktaba al-Shamila.
authors:
  - family-names: Benjelloun
    given-names: Khalid
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kmbenjel/turath-catalog"
url: "https://warraq.benjelloun.dev/turath-catalog/"
keywords:
  - Arabic
  - bibliography
  - turath
  - printed editions
  - manuscripts
  - Hijri calendar
  - OpenITI
  - Wikidata
  - digital humanities
  - Islamic studies
